        {
          "_key": "k000s8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Doors open at 6 am. Breakfast is from 7:30 to 9 am, lunch is at 12 noon and snack is at 3 pm, all through the USDA food program (CACFP). Children who stay late have dinner at 6 pm. Between meals there's reading and homework time, art, building, games and time with friends. Children can stay until 11 pm if you work a late shift."
